    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take to the skies with Amelie, a curious young cat on her very first flight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by whispers of an ancient legend, she sets off in a handmade seaplane to uncover the truth behind the mysterious Sky Island. Fly across vast oceans, land on uncharted islands, and explore their hidden corners. Each island is filled with environmental puzzles, secrets from a lost civilization, and perhaps even clues that lead to Sky Island itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll meet strange and charming characters, each with their own stories to tell. Some may help you. Others may need your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Does the Sky Island truly exist? What forgotten history lies buried in this world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, Amelie isn\u2019t alone. Her loyal friend\u2014Antoine, a genius feline engineer\u2014is always by her side, providing clever inventions and steadfast support throughout the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navi: Catplane Chronicle is a puzzle adventure game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonds with Charming Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amelie\u2019s longtime friend, Antoine, a genius feline engineer, is a reliable companion who quietly supports the search for Sky Island with his inventions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to Antoine, players will encounter a variety of characters during their journey, each with their own personality and backstory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build bonds with them and immerse yourself even deeper in exploration and puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/e61b4881a0360d644068e8360e4097c7.poster.avif?t=1750555498\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/e61b4881a0360d644068e8360e4097c7.webm?t=1750555498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/e61b4881a0360d644068e8360e4097c7.mp4?t=1750555498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the World in a Seaplane</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seaplane, built by the genius engineer Antoine, is your reliable means of transportation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot the plane to discover uncharted islands and soar through the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land on the water to find new paths and continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/66593e306fd5d76406a9796aaceacbab.poster.avif?t=1750555498\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/66593e306fd5d76406a9796aaceacbab.webm?t=1750555498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/66593e306fd5d76406a9796aaceacbab.mp4?t=1750555498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles to continue your adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each island is filled with a variety of puzzles waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve them by using the island\u2019s environment, terrain, and mechanisms to gain new items or unlock hidden paths to the next area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere within those puzzles, you might even find clues that reveal the secrets of Sky Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/3fed20a860ff96e6ce1e7555cec1af04.poster.avif?t=1750555498\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/3fed20a860ff96e6ce1e7555cec1af04.webm?t=1750555498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/3fed20a860ff96e6ce1e7555cec1af04.mp4?t=1750555498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/ecbbb37ffa0e7a9c833d0a26af19e39d.poster.avif?t=1750555498\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/ecbbb37ffa0e7a9c833d0a26af19e39d.webm?t=1750555498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/ecbbb37ffa0e7a9c833d0a26af19e39d.mp4?t=1750555498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the truth hidden within the island</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first glance, it may seem like an ordinary island\u2014but look closely, and you might discover something concealed beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What kind of past does this island hold? Where exactly is this place?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With patience and careful exploration, you might just find the key to uncovering traces of an ancient civilization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/be32c1cdbb9a64d3a007dd13f4ff5738.poster.avif?t=1750555498\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/be32c1cdbb9a64d3a007dd13f4ff5738.webm?t=1750555498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/be32c1cdbb9a64d3a007dd13f4ff5738.mp4?t=1750555498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start a new adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/2c3ad52d2fb54341bb777689d79a9633.poster.avif?t=1750555498\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/2c3ad52d2fb54341bb777689d79a9633.webm?t=1750555498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828420/extras/2c3ad52d2fb54341bb777689d79a9633.mp4?t=1750555498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
